        "b12_notes": {"type": "notes", "settings": {"text": "<p>UraGuard® is a physical barrier. It is not a treatment for, and is not intended to prevent, any medical condition.</p><p>†Independent laboratory testing (AATCC 100) of UraGuard technology in a diaper format, compared to a standard diaper after 8 hours.</p><p>¹Omli R, Skotnes LH, Romild U, Kuhry E. “The use of absorbent pads increases the risk for lower urinary tract infections in nursing homes residents.” International Continence Society, 2008, Abstract 233. Prospective 1-year study of 160 Norwegian nursing-home residents aged 65+; shows an association, not cause and effect.</p>"}}
